# Base: seleron/vitabrowser (patch stack through 344)
#
# css_computed_min_width() turns `auto` into 0 unless the element itself
# is a flex container. The automatic minimum belongs to flex ITEMS, so
# layout needs the raw answer. This mirrors the existing
# css_computed_min_height_is_auto().
